    "text": "KWQC\nwebsite\nRock Falls\nRock Falls to host 2nd annual Spooktacular Halloween parade\nBy KWQC Staff,\n15 hours agoROCK FALLS, Ill. (KWQC) - Rock Falls is gearing up for its second annual Spooktacular Halloween Lighted Golf Cart and UTV Parade this month. People are encouraged to choose a theme, dress in costume and decorate their golf carts or UTVs in their best Halloween style for the community event, officials said.\n2",
